{"id":"n82136-1-9","stage":0,"title":"주다 · 给予","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82136-1-9-1","ko":"이건 뭐니?","zh":"这是什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이건","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이건","audio":"/audio/5a674df42cc1d8ac9ff2.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐니?","meaning":"什么（询问事物或情况）","explanation":"뭐：什么（询问事物或情况）；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐니","audio":"/audio/c123f71de2e0a9dffdf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么（询问事物或情况）","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"什么（询问事物或情况）","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/1afb18203cd3f13a10af.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82136-1-9-2","ko":"친구가 저에게 준 선물이에요.","zh":"是朋友送给我的礼物哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친구가","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구가","audio":"/audio/61bf5bfb043d2161ceed.mp3"}},{"text":"저에게","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저에게","audio":"/audio/a1785401c23e86641841.mp3"}},{"text":"준","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준","audio":"/audio/380bd5afbff5e69e5943.mp3"}},{"text":"선물이에요.","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선물이에요","audio":"/audio/617f4b35445bafc4a436.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]}],"audio":"/audio/d6396b065b9a48ec4925.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.02,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82136","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":3,"sequenceScore":-0.3702,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是朋友送给我的礼物哦。","能借一下电话吗？","这是什么呀？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是朋友送给我的礼物哦。","这是什么呀？","能借一下电话吗？"],"answer":0}]}
